{
  "_README": "PSX multi-year financials for the IM3 history layer. Each name's arrays are NEWEST-FIRST, up to 6 fiscal years, in RAW PKR (PKR 401 billion = 401000000000), EPS in PKR/share. Leave a value null if unavailable; a name needs >=3 years of 'rev' to be used (else it falls back to the TV single-period reduced score). Source: AKD / Topline / JS Global models or the company annual-report 5-6yr summary.",
  "_HOWTO": "1) Open the holding's annual report (5-6yr financial summary) or broker model. 2) Type the last ~5 years into the null slots, newest first. 3) Commit this file. 4) Run the Daily Dashboard Scan once. 5) That name's PSX row jumps from the reduced score to /162 with forensics. Minimum viable set per name: rev, op, np_, eps_s, cfo, fcf, td, eq0s, ta_s, ca_s, cl_s, re_s, ar_s, inv_s.",
  "_key_map": {
    "income_statement": "rev(revenue) cogs(cost of sales) sga(admin+selling) op(operating profit) pbt(profit before tax) tax_exp(taxation) np_(profit after tax) eps_s(EPS) int_exp(finance cost) ebitda_s(EBITDA) dep(depreciation)",
    "balance_sheet": "ppe(fixed assets) td(total borrowings) ltd(long-term borrowings) eq0s(total equity) ta_s(total assets) ca_s(current assets) cl_s(current liabilities) re_s(unappropriated profit/retained earnings) ar_s(trade debts) ap_s(trade payables) inv_s(stock-in-trade) cash_s(cash & bank) sti_s(short-term investments)",
    "cash_flow": "cfo(net cash from operations) fcf(CFO minus capex) ncc(net change in cash) div_paid(dividends paid) buyback issuance(usually 0)",
    "bank_only": "loans(advances) deps(deposits) npl_s(non-performing loans) + _bank_system_b: nim casa adr npl car"
  },
  "_status": {
    "OGDC": "FILLED from stockanalysis.com (S&P Global), FY2021-FY2025 (fiscal Jul-Jun), millions->raw PKR. Replaces earlier template. VERIFY vs broker.",
    "PPL": "FILLED from stockanalysis.com (S&P Global Market Intelligence), FY2021-FY2025, millions->raw PKR. VERIFY against AKD/Topline before fully trusting.",
    "FFC": "FILLED from stockanalysis.com (S&P Global), FY2021-FY2025 (calendar yr), millions->raw PKR. Note: FY24 jump = FFBL consolidation. VERIFY vs broker.",
    "HUBC": "FILLED from stockanalysis.com (S&P Global, utility template), FY2021-FY2025, millions->raw PKR. Note: net income is associate-income heavy (CPHGC/Thar). VERIFY vs broker.",
    "MCB": "ACTIVE (bank model). Income+CashFlow real S&P 5yr (FY21-25). Bank extras nim/adr/npl from real broker series; CASA/CAR NA (not free). Non-financial constructs (Altman/Beneish/Piotroski/FCF/EV) zero-weighted for banks by design. System-B ratios from MCB Q3'25 release. VERIFY vs broker (JS/AKD/Topline)."
  },
